  <item>
    <title>她</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63e7a8a30d7e8eaa72668d66</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63e7a8a30d7e8eaa72668d66</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 11 Feb 2023 14:39:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《她》</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;她上了车，三两步挨着窗落座。骄阳似我，被烤炽，被蒸腾，被柳絮飘忽的初夏之风贴面卷过。我痴痴的站，旭旭的看。她在那儿，净彻玻璃后的清晰人影，为慵懒人群遮挡的绰绰。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;我的心脏稳健的跳动着，似风。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/FpHrmPPP6upKKIufxHXj2P5kYayX.m4a" length="466688" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:00:28</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiCXFmAqOWQlsiXF_vbXwT0WfLDu.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>无题</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63e7a5ea51a4e4150a3b2473</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63e7a5ea51a4e4150a3b2473</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 11 Feb 2023 14:27:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《无题》</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;好安静啊，安静的有股不真实感，仿佛熟识的面孔都被揩了去，捂住口鼻，丧尽呼吸。内里有什么东西悠悠的升起来，在半空打晃，像过山车俯冲轨道前十分之一秒，心惊肉跳。愈安静，愈不安，我还存在吗？是，我是的。倘若前方是天空，我就张臂向上；倘若是大海，我便自然下坠；但倘若是你，我要立在原地静静地听，直至周遭都热闹起来，直到喧腾到无法忍受。瞧，你就是我的声音。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/FlBrNOo-WY62mMEYAUeJ41772rnP.m4a" length="978514" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:01:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiCXFmAqOWQlsiXF_vbXwT0WfLDu.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>平凡的一天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63e7a3bd51a4e4150a3aed30</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63e7a3bd51a4e4150a3aed30</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 11 Feb 2023 14:18:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《平凡的一天》</span></p><p><span>——写于2020年7月18日</span></p><p><span>黄色的布偶</span></p><p><span>俯视地面</span></p><p><span>四只脚的野兽</span></p><p><span>有四层高的灵魂</span></p><p><span>不怕风</span></p><p><span>不怕雨</span></p><p><span>不怕暴晒与浸润</span></p><p><span>没法呼吸</span></p><p><span>不能发声</span></p><p><span>两只铁家伙追它</span></p><p><span>追到它</span></p><p><span>裂成三段</span></p><p><span>头到颈</span></p><p><span>肩到臀</span></p><p><span>还有那漂亮的尾巴</span></p><p><span>低低垂下</span></p><p><span>似它的头颅</span></p><p><span>看哪</span></p><p><span>两只前掌着空</span></p><p><span>两只后脚抬起</span></p><p><span>这不是死亡</span></p><p><span>是重生</span></p><p><span>脑袋到屁股的重量</span></p><p><span>坠的</span></p><p><span>两个家伙招架不住</span></p><p><span>摇摆起来</span></p><p><span>像远处的声音</span></p><p><span>听</span></p><p><span>沉默的声音</span></p><p><span>无声的兽</span></p><p><span>喧腾的风</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/FoT6vlSgh-UDEhSqiRaM65C-VjCJ.m4a" length="882393" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:00:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiCXFmAqOWQlsiXF_vbXwT0WfLDu.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
